      "retweeted_tweet_id": null,
      "text": "🚨 Life-Saving Response🚨 \nRecently our Alpine Air Unit answered the call after a serious two-vehicle rollover crash involving a @USBPChiefBBT Border Patrol Agent near Presidio, TX.  An AS350 crew with an AMO EMT onboard rapidly deployed, providing critical medical assistance alongside local EMS. When the agent’s condition worsened during transport, our team coordinated a swift transfer to a medevac helicopter, ensuring advanced care. Proud to stand with our law enforcement partners and deliver lifesaving support when it matters most! #FirstResponders #LifeSaved",
